WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:02.430
We want to influence the economic system.

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:06.050
Our ambition is to influence one billion people

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:07.750
to choose more sustainably.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.750
When our choices change, demand changes.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.510
When businesses respond at scale,

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.950
the economic system can shift.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:20.770
We are taking more than the Earth can give back.

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:25.630
Our lives, livelihoods and future depend on changing this.

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:27.630
Solutions exist.

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:31.190
Bertrand Piccard’s Solar Impulse Foundation

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:34.230
has labelled more than 1,600 solutions.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:38.050
Knowledge, technology and capital exist.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:42.150
Yet our actions do not match our intentions.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.390
Culture moves faster than governance.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:50.330
Art, music, film, festivals, fashion and sport

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:52.870
bring ideas into everyday life.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:55.170
BEE is our innovation.

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:59.510
We are developing it to turn intention into action.

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:01.730
One choice at a time.

00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:07.070
SociisGroup serves humanity by changing how the world behaves.

